<title>FRANCE: French May official reserves 318.91 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>French May official reserves 318.91 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of France and finance ministry gave the following breakdown of offical gold and foreign exchange reserves (in billions of francs)</p>
<p>					  May    Apr</p>
<p> Total reserves		   318.910  318.939</p>
<p> Gold				 159.521  159.521</p>
<p> Ecu				   54.628   54.628</p>
<p> Foreign exchange		  86.049   85.940</p>
<p> Credits with IMF		  18.712   18.850</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
